    "1099 forms for contract or gig income." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Formularios 1099 por ingresos de contrato o trabajos esporádicos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于合同或零工收入的 1099 表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few quick questions so Cuevi can tailor the checklist." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unas preguntas rápidas para que Cuevi ajuste la lista."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回答几个小问题，Cuevi 就能为你定制清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A first plan can be one page — you can refine it later." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un primer plan puede ser de una página; puedes pulirlo después."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一版计划一页纸就行——以后可以再完善。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A free USCIS online account lets you file, pay, upload documents, and track your case." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una cuenta en línea gratuita de USCIS te permite presentar, pagar, subir documentos y seguir tu caso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费的 USCIS 在线账户可用于提交、缴费、上传文件和跟踪案件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A health permit if you handle food." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un permiso sanitario si manejas alimentos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你经营食品，需要卫生许可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A job (W-2)" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un empleo (W-2)"
