        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有工作（W-2）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A list of your medicines, doses, and allergies." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una lista de tus medicamentos, dosis y alergias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的用药、剂量和过敏清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little prep makes the visit go smoothly." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un poco de preparación hace que la cita vaya bien."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做一点准备能让就诊更顺利。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A photo or screenshot you already have" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una foto o captura que ya tienes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手机里已有的照片或截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick to-do with a date — Cuevi reminds you before it's due." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una tarea rápida con fecha — Cuevi te avisa antes de que venza."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速添加一个带日期的待办——到期前 Cuevi 会提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recent change — lost coverage, moved, married, had a baby, or job change?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Un cambio reciente: perdiste cobertura, te mudaste, te casaste, tuviste un bebé o cambiaste de trabajo?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近有变化吗——失去保险、搬家、结婚、生孩子或换工作？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recent life change may open a Special Enrollment Period — you can sign up now, outside open enrollment." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un cambio de vida reciente puede abrir un Período Especial de Inscripción: puedes inscribirte ahora, fuera de la inscripción abierta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "近期的人生变化可能开启“特殊参保期”——你现在就能参保，无需等公开参保期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A referral, if your plan needs one for a specialist." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una remisión, si tu plan la exige para un especialista."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你的保险看专科需要转诊，带上转诊单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A refund means money back; owing means you pay — filing on time avoids penalties either way." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un reembolso significa que te devuelven dinero; deber significa que pagas: en ambos casos, declarar a tiempo evita multas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退税意味着拿回钱；欠税意味着要补缴——无论哪种，按时报税都能避免罚款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second ID if the bank asks for two." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una segunda identificación si el banco pide dos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果银行要求两份证件，再准备第二份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A security deposit is usually about one month's rent; you should get it back (minus any damage) after you move out." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El depósito suele ser un mes de alquiler; deberías recuperarlo (menos cualquier daño) al mudarte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "押金通常约为一个月房租；搬走后应退还给你（扣除任何损坏）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A separate business account keeps your bookkeeping clean and protects an LLC's liability shield. Bring your EIN and formation documents." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una cuenta de empresa separada mantiene limpia la contabilidad y protege el escudo de responsabilidad de la LLC. Lleva tu EIN y los documentos de constitución."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单独的公司账户能让记账清晰，并维护 LLC 的责任隔离。带上你的 EIN 和成立文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sole proprietorship is simplest but doesn't separate your personal assets. An LLC costs a state fee but protects your personal assets if the business is sued or owes money." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ser empresario individual es lo más simple pero no separa tus bienes personales. Una LLC cuesta una tarifa estatal pero protege tus bienes si demandan al negocio o este debe dinero."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个体经营最简单，但不隔离个人资产。LLC 需缴一笔州费用，但当公司被起诉或欠债时能保护你的个人资产。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A step-by-step checklist for buying a home, from pre-approval to closing." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
