    "After filing, save a copy of your return and confirmation; if you're owed a refund, track it with the IRS 'Where's My Refund?' tool." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después de declarar, guarda una copia de tu declaración y la confirmación; si te corresponde un reembolso, síguelo con la herramienta “Where's My Refund?” del IRS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报税后，保存报税表和确认回执的副本；如果有退税，用 IRS 的“Where's My Refund?”工具查询进度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After wiring, call to confirm the money arrived." : {
