        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果还没报警，请补上——尤其是有人受伤或损失严重时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File by the deadline — usually April 15. Can't make it? File an extension, but any tax owed is still due then." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Declara antes de la fecha límite, normalmente el 15 de abril. ¿No llegas? Pide una prórroga, pero los impuestos adeudados vencen igualmente ese día."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在截止日期前报税——通常是 4 月 15 日。来不及？可申请延期，但应缴税款仍需在该日前缴清。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File for free if you qualify: IRS Free File online, or a VITA site for free in-person help." : {
