            "value" : "如果收到 RFE、NOID 或法院通知，请联系正规的法律帮助——不要依赖社交媒体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need an interpreter, ask for one when you book — it's free at most clinics." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
