        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果需要翻译，预约时就提出——大多数诊所免费提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you pick a Marketplace plan, pay the first premium — coverage doesn't start until you do." : {
