    "Public schools generally can't deny enrollment based on immigration status. If asked for an SSN, ask whether it's optional or if another ID can be used." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las escuelas públicas no pueden negar la inscripción por el estatus migratorio. Si te piden un SSN, pregunta si es opcional o si puedes usar otra identificación."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "公立学校通常不能因移民身份拒绝入学。若被要求提供 SSN，可询问是否为可选项，或能否用其他证件代替。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Public schools must offer English-language help and can't turn your child away." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
