    "Your plan's provider directory lists doctors who are in-network (lower cost). Find it on the back of your insurance card or your insurer's website." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El directorio de tu plan lista los médicos dentro de la red (menor costo). Lo encuentras al dorso de tu tarjeta o en la web de tu aseguradora."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你保险计划的医生目录会列出网络内（费用更低）的医生。可在保险卡背面或保险公司网站上找到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your policy number — or the at-fault driver's insurer and policy number." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
