            "value" : "你的保单号——或责任方司机的保险公司和保单号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your receipt number (3 letters then numbers, e.g. IOE…) is on your I-797 receipt notice — keep it in Details so it's easy to find." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
